<section class="Myaccordion pt-0 ">
    <div class="container">
        <h4 class="text-center" style="color: #ED334F;">FAQ</h4>
        <h3 class="text-center pb-3">Frequently Asked Questions</h3>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-12">
                <div class="panel-group" id="accordion" role="tablist" aria-multiselectable="true">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading" role="tab" id="headingOne">
                            <h4 class="panel-title">
                                <a role="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="#collapseOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseOne">
                                    I would like to upgrade my plain. Is this possible?
                                </a>
                            </h4>
                        </div>
                        <div id="collapseOne" class="panel-collapse collapse in" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="headingOne">
                            <div class="panel-body">
                                <p>Unfortunately, upgrading your current Advertisement package is not an option at this time. However, you can always purchase an additional package, which will be added to your account without losing any listings from your original package.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading" role="tab" id="headingTwo">
                            <h4 class="panel-title">
                                <a class="collapsed" role="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="#collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTwo">
                                    Is VAT included in the price?
                                </a>
                            </h4>
                        </div>
                        <div id="collapseTwo" class="panel-collapse collapse" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="headingTwo">
                            <div class="panel-body">
                                <p>VAT will be calculated and added during checkout.  </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading" role="tab" id="headingThree">
                            <h4 class="panel-title">
                                <a class="collapsed" role="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="#collapseThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseThree">
                                    Do i need to buy complete new package when i have used all the top listings or other enhancement in my package.
                                </a>
                            </h4>
                        </div>
                        <div id="collapseThree" class="panel-collapse collapse" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="headingThree">
                            <div class="panel-body">
                                <p>No, that won't be necessary. Just add the enhancement of your choice to your Listing and you can pay for it separately.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
